              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"136b89f5-83d0-4ecd-b542-22bd86c288a6\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>a)  Решим урав­не­ние:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"(2\\cos x+1)(\\sqrt{-\\sin x}-1)=0\\iff \\begin{cases}-\\sin x\\ge 0\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}2\\cos x+1=0\\\\\\sqrt{-\\sin x}-1=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\begin{cases}\\sin x\\le 0\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}2\\cos x=-1\\\\-\\sin x=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\begin{cases}\\sin x\\le 0\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\sin x=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=-\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k\\\\x=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </span></p><p></p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"2c0af997-4942-44af-9198-a528262a1cda\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\"/></p><p>б)  Корни, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[0;\\frac{3\\pi}{2}]\"></span> ,  отберём с по­мо­щью еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти. По­лу­ча­ем  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Решение",
